note <Browser HMAC implementation. Forwards to the linked crypto runtime shim, which wraps the Web Crypto API (globalThis.crypto.subtle). Internal: reached only through the public hmac API.>

dock load
  load <global:crypto>, name crypto

task hmac-sha256
  mark async
  take key, like text
  take data, like text
  like text
  send back
    call crypto/hmac-sha256
      read key
      read data

task hmac-sha512
  mark async
  take key, like text
  take data, like text
  like text
  send back
    call crypto/hmac-sha512
      read key
      read data
